              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alisitaako, omunyankomo mugenzi wange, naabaramukya; na Mariko mwihwa wa Baranaba (ou nabamanyisizeho kara obu alibahikaho, mumutangirre kurungi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yesu, anyakwetwa Yusito, naabaramukya. Omu bakozi bataahi bange abarukukorra obukama bwa Ruhanga, banu bonka nubo abaasazirwe, kandi bakampuumuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
