              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebbaruha enu obu erikamara kubasomerwa, mugitwekere ab'ekitebe ky'abaikiriza aba Layodikeeya bagisome; kandi na inywe musome ebbaruha eriruga Layodikeeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
